  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A glass block has a refractive index in air of n<sub>g</sub>. The glass block is placed in two different liquids: liquid X with a refractive index of n<sub>X</sub> and liquid Y with a refractive index of n<sub>Y</sub>.</p>\n<p>In liquid X <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{n_{g}}{n_{X}}=2\"></span> and in liquid Y <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{n_{g}}{n_{Y}}=1.5.\"></span> What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{speed of light in liquid X}}{\\textit{speed of light in liquid Y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
